[primer-wasm
 [doc [#
What the playground's wasm engine cannot reproduce among the primer's
examples, and why — read by primer_examples.cx, which copies each reason onto
its entry (`wasmUnsupported`), so the page says it beside the example instead
of presenting the engine's different answer as the fixture's.

One [differs id=… why=…] per example. The list is GRADED, not trusted:
`make test-playground-primer` fails an example listed here that in fact
answers as its fixture records (a marker nobody needs any more is a lie the
page tells), and fails an unlisted example that does not. A row naming an id
the primer does not cite is refused by the generator.
#]]

]
